s should be:\n\n1. Verify GitHub and restore the newest work across the relevant branches.\n2. Restore all ten agents and the four unfinished Screen 05 work streams.\n3. Verify both Marble worlds and existing Blender imports.\n4. Restore all required development tools and MCP integrations.\n5. Enable and test five-minute GitHub autosave.\n6. Capture the current playable Screen 05.\n7. Resume the approved Screen 05 reconstruction using the existing Marble assets and specialists.\n\nGive me a concise recovery report, then continue meaningful visual improvement.\n\nDo not start another Rainbow project.\n\nDo not regenerate assets already saved.\n\nDo not spend additional credits without approval.\n\nMY FINAL GOAL: A gorgeous, premium-quality, REAL PLAYABLE 3D Android Rainbow game that closely matches my original approved artwork.\n\nPlease recover everything safely and continue from exactly where the previous Claude account stopped.", "operation": "enqueue", "sessionId": "78821565-d674-5be9-a7dd-5afd2dc12d7a", "timestamp": "2026-11-16T02:12:45.840Z", "type": "queue-operation"}
